# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites every file
# to CRLF on commit, so a file touched on Windows and one touched on Linux show
# as fully changed even when no line changed. Text is stored as LF; working
# copies on Windows may still be CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows batch files must keep CRLF: cmd.exe mis-parses LF-only .bat files.
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Binary types must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.webm binary
*.jar binary
